# Safety net for builds that use the repository root as context without their own <Dockerfile>.dockerignore
# (infra/docker/*.Dockerfile.dockerignore are the precise lists): never send secrets or local state.
.git
.claude
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.zip
*.dump
*.dump.*
backups
